1
00:00:00,191 --> 00:00:01,901
(Leonard:)I can't believe you're
married to that idiot.

2
00:00:02,059 --> 00:00:04,399
(Penny:)Would you stop?
We just did it as a goof.

3
00:00:04,562 --> 00:00:05,972
(Leonard:)Well, a goof or not,
you're actually married.

4
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,730
(Leonard:)You need to get
this taken care of.

5
00:00:07,898 --> 00:00:10,208
(Penny:)I will. Why are you
making this such a big deal?

6
00:00:10,367 --> 00:00:12,367
Oh! I have a reason.

7
00:00:12,536 --> 00:00:15,246
(Sheldon:)It could be because
you said yes to marrying Zack,

8
00:00:15,406 --> 00:00:16,906
(Sheldon:)but every time
Leonard's proposed,

9
00:00:17,074 --> 00:00:18,574
(Sheldon:)he's gotten a resounding no.

10
00:00:20,578 --> 00:00:23,578
(Sheldon:)That's just off the top of my head.

11
00:00:23,747 --> 00:00:25,417
(Penny:)So how do I undo this?

12
00:00:25,583 --> 00:00:26,923
(Leonard:)I'm hoping you can
get an annulment,

13
00:00:27,084 --> 00:00:28,494
so it's just like
it never happened.

14
00:00:28,652 --> 00:00:30,192
(Penny:)Great, well, what do I have to do?

15
00:00:30,354 --> 00:00:31,854
(Amy:)It says here
you can get an annulment

16
00:00:32,022 --> 00:00:33,662
(Amy:)if any of the following
conditions are met.

17
00:00:33,824 --> 00:00:35,664
"Were you unable
to consummate the marriage?"

18
00:00:35,826 --> 00:00:37,496
(Sheldon:)Penny? Next.

19
00:00:39,597 --> 00:00:42,097
"Is there any evidence
of fraud, bigamy,

20
00:00:42,266 --> 00:00:43,716
want of understanding?"

21
00:00:43,868 --> 00:00:44,748
(Amy:)Want of understanding?

22
00:00:44,902 --> 00:00:45,782
(Penny:)What does that even mean?

23
00:00:45,936 --> 00:00:47,676
(Amy:)Ding, ding, ding.
We have a winner.

24
00:00:50,174 --> 00:00:51,554
(Bernadette:)Thanks for saving the day.

25
00:00:51,709 --> 00:00:52,689
(Raj:)No problem.

26
00:00:52,843 --> 00:00:53,843
(Raj:)It wouldn't be Thanksgiving

27
00:00:54,011 --> 00:00:58,021
(Raj:)without an Indian
providing the food.

